SUMMARY:Jackie Ryan and the Larry Vuckovich Quartet at Brannan Center
DESCRIPTION:Experience Jackie Ryan and the Larry Vuckovich Quartet at Brannan Center\, featuring internationally acclaimed pianist Larry Vuckovich and legendary jazz vocalist Jackie Ryan. Together for 30 years\, they deliver a dynamic blend of bebop\, blues\, gospel\, Latin classics\, and world music\, showcasing unmatched versatility. The ensemble also includes multi-reed saxophonist Noel Jewkes\, hard-swinging bassist Buca Necak\, and master drummer Jeff Minnie\, offering a rich\, immersive jazz journey for every listener.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/jackie-ryan-and-the-larry-vuckovich-quartet-at-brannan-center/
LOCATION:1407 Third Street , Calistoga, CA, 94574, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/03225545/6940ec2757f3198a62bc37d9_BC_JackieLarryQuartet_1920x1080.jpg
END:VEVENT
